he $q$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{a}_{1}+q{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 2[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]+q[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}18 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ q[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}18 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]-2[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\ q[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}14 \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $q=2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-67278fa9-bfc0-5fba-ae59-83c26db20f9a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-67278fa9-bfc0-5fba-ae59-83c26db20f9a" :answer-field/id #uuid "67278fa9-bfc0-5fba-ae59-83c26db20f9a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c9625aa7-0555-551d-ba77-01777f30c63d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-67535166-0c7e-5160-8989-abee9b724e2f" "answer-c9d8d7ac-e8e5-5005-8c8b-0a4a33651697" "answer-d1b95b72-f366-5e7c-8edc-5448f9b86cda" "answer-c9625aa7-0555-551d-ba77-01777f30c63d" "answer-9420a97a-1b67-58ee-8e48-ea180d4e1322"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-67535166-0c7e-5160-8989-abee9b724e2f" :answer/id #uuid "67535166-0c7e-5160-8989-abee9b724e2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c9d8d7ac-e8e5-5005-8c8b-0a4a33651697" :answer/id #uuid "c9d8d7ac-e8e5-5005-8c8b-0a4a33651697" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d1b95b72-f366-5e7c-8edc-5448f9b86cda" :answer/id #uuid "d1b95b72-f366-5e7c-8edc-5448f9b86cda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c9625aa7-0555-551d-ba77-01777f30c63d" :answer/id #uuid "c9625aa7-0555-551d-ba77-01777f30c63d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9420a97a-1b67-58ee-8e48-ea180d4e1322" :answer/id #uuid "9420a97a-1b67-58ee-8e48-ea180d4e1322" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f6e40000-d3bb-5e63-9aa5-9e060c0e21d3" :question/id #uuid "f6e40000-d3bb-5e63-9aa5-9e060c0e21d3" :question/math-academy-id "q-105153" :question/problem "Find $k$, if $6{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $k$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 6[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]+k[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\ k[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]-6[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\ k[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-10 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 18\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $k=-2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-90a55e28-fe9d-5f4d-b992-64ed7ca312c6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-90a55e28-fe9d-5f4d-b992-64ed7ca312c6" :answer-field/id #uuid "90a55e28-fe9d-5f4d-b992-64ed7ca312c6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d7582991-42f6-598d-b22f-86bb055d2380" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d7582991-42f6-598d-b22f-86bb055d2380" "answer-2813de20-ae90-5665-b4a2-be2d2da6cfd5" "answer-09a68c36-28bf-56b7-82ce-363a6cd0aec1" "answer-000e2b43-7a32-5785-9d4a-cc0099f8dbd2" "answer-1609e0df-99da-5341-bdc8-02d9d8eee654"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d7582991-42f6-598d